[{"s":88,"a":5,"en":"They will be given drink from a boiling spring.","w":[["تُسۡقَىٰ","They will be given to drink"],["مِنۡ","from"],["عَيۡنٍ","a spring"],["ءَانِيَةٖ","boiling"]]},{"s":95,"a":6,"en":"Except for those who believe and do righteous deeds, for they will have a reward uninterrupted.","w":[["إِلَّا","Except"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who"],["ءَامَنُواْ","believe"],["وَعَمِلُواْ","and do"],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ","righteous deeds"],["فَلَهُمۡ","then for them"],["أَجۡرٌ","(is a) reward"],["غَيۡرُ","never"],["مَمۡنُونٖ","ending"]]},{"s":68,"a":9,"en":"They wish that you would soften [in your position], so they would soften [toward you].","w":[["وَدُّواْ","They wish"],["لَوۡ","that"],["تُدۡهِنُ","you should compromise"],["فَيُدۡهِنُونَ","so they would compromise"]]},{"s":102,"a":8,"en":"Then you will surely be asked that Day about pleasure.","w":[["ثُمَّ","Then"],["لَتُسۡـَٔلُنَّ","surely you will be asked"],["يَوۡمَئِذٍ","that Day"],["عَنِ","about"],["ٱلنَّعِيمِ","the pleasures"]]},{"s":24,"a":7,"en":"And the fifth [oath will be] that the curse of Allah be upon him if he should be among the liars.","w":[["وَٱلۡخَٰمِسَةُ","And the fifth"],["أَنَّ","that"],["لَعۡنَتَ","(the) curse of Allah"],["ٱللَّهِ","(the) curse of Allah"],["عَلَيۡهِ","(be) upon him"],["إِن","if"],["كَانَ","he is"],["مِنَ","of"],["ٱلۡكَٰذِبِينَ","the liars"]]},{"s":70,"a":39,"en":"No! Indeed, We have created them from that which they know.","w":[["كَلَّآۖ","By no means"],["إِنَّا","Indeed,We"],["خَلَقۡنَٰهُم","[We] have created them"],["مِّمَّا","from what"],["يَعۡلَمُونَ","they know"]]},{"s":57,"a":3,"en":"He is the First and the Last, the Ascendant and the Intimate, and He is, of all things, Knowing.","w":[["هُوَ","He"],["ٱلۡأَوَّلُ","(is) the First"],["وَٱلۡأٓخِرُ","and the Last"],["وَٱلظَّـٰهِرُ","and the Apparent"],["وَٱلۡبَاطِنُۖ","and the Unapparent"],["وَهُوَ","and He"],["بِكُلِّ","(is) of every"],["شَيۡءٍ","thing"],["عَلِيمٌ","All-Knower"]]},{"s":72,"a":26,"en":"[He is] Knower of the unseen, and He does not disclose His [knowledge of the] unseen to anyone","w":[["عَٰلِمُ","(The) All-Knower"],["ٱلۡغَيۡبِ","(of) the unseen"],["فَلَا","so not"],["يُظۡهِرُ","He reveals"],["عَلَىٰ","from"],["غَيۡبِهِۦٓ","His unseen"],["أَحَدًا","(to) anyone"]]},{"s":96,"a":8,"en":"Indeed, to your Lord is the return.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["إِلَىٰ","to"],["رَبِّكَ","your Lord"],["ٱلرُّجۡعَىٰٓ","(is) the return"]]},{"s":4,"a":120,"en":"Satan promises them and arouses desire in them. But Satan does not promise them except delusion.","w":[["يَعِدُهُمۡ","He promises them"],["وَيُمَنِّيهِمۡۖ","and arouses desires in them"],["وَمَا","and not"],["يَعِدُهُمُ","promises them"],["ٱلشَّيۡطَٰنُ","the Shaitaan"],["إِلَّا","except"],["غُرُورًا","deception"]]},{"s":45,"a":4,"en":"And in the creation of yourselves and what He disperses of moving creatures are signs for people who are certain [in faith].","w":[["وَفِي","And in"],["خَلۡقِكُمۡ","your creation"],["وَمَا","and what"],["يَبُثُّ","He disperses"],["مِن","of"],["دَآبَّةٍ","(the) moving creatures"],["ءَايَٰتٞ","(are) Signs"],["لِّقَوۡمٖ","for a people"],["يُوقِنُونَ","who are certain"]]},{"s":16,"a":47,"en":"Or that He would not seize them gradually [in a state of dread]? But indeed, your Lord is Kind and Merciful.","w":[["أَوۡ","Or"],["يَأۡخُذَهُمۡ","that He may seize them"],["عَلَىٰ","with"],["تَخَوُّفٖ","a gradual wasting"],["فَإِنَّ","But indeed"],["رَبَّكُمۡ","your Lord"],["لَرَءُوفٞ","(is) surely Full of Kindness"],["رَّحِيمٌ","Most Merciful"]]},{"s":58,"a":21,"en":"Allah has written, \"I will surely overcome, I and My messengers.\" Indeed, Allah is Powerful and Exalted in Might.","w":[["كَتَبَ","Allah has decreed"],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah has decreed"],["لَأَغۡلِبَنَّ","Surely,I will overcome"],["أَنَا۠","I"],["وَرُسُلِيٓۚ","and My Messengers"],["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["قَوِيٌّ","(is) All-Strong"],["عَزِيزٞ","All-Mighty"]]},{"s":65,"a":9,"en":"And it tasted the bad consequence of its affair, and the outcome of its affair was loss.","w":[["فَذَاقَتۡ","So it tasted"],["وَبَالَ","(the bad) consequence"],["أَمۡرِهَا","(of) its affair"],["وَكَانَ","and was"],["عَٰقِبَةُ","(the) end"],["أَمۡرِهَا","(of) its affair"],["خُسۡرًا","loss"]]},{"s":69,"a":46,"en":"Then We would have cut from him the aorta.","w":[["ثُمَّ","Then"],["لَقَطَعۡنَا","certainly We (would) have cut off"],["مِنۡهُ","from him"],["ٱلۡوَتِينَ","the aorta"]]},{"s":11,"a":21,"en":"Those are the ones who will have lost themselves, and lost from them is what they used to invent.","w":[["أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","Those"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(are) the ones who"],["خَسِرُوٓاْ","(have) lost"],["أَنفُسَهُمۡ","their souls"],["وَضَلَّ","and lost"],["عَنۡهُم","from them"],["مَّا","(is) what"],["كَانُواْ","they used"],["يَفۡتَرُونَ","(to) invent"]]},{"s":7,"a":16,"en":"[Satan] said, \"Because You have put me in error, I will surely sit in wait for them on Your straight path.","w":[["قَالَ","(Shaitaan) said"],["فَبِمَآ","Because"],["أَغۡوَيۡتَنِي","You have sent me astray"],["لَأَقۡعُدَنَّ","surely I will sit"],["لَهُمۡ","for them"],["صِرَٰطَكَ","(on) Your path"],["ٱلۡمُسۡتَقِيمَ","the straight"]]},{"s":8,"a":14,"en":"\"That [is yours], so taste it.\" And indeed for the disbelievers is the punishment of the Fire.","w":[["ذَٰلِكُمۡ","That"],["فَذُوقُوهُ","So taste it"],["وَأَنَّ","And that"],["لِلۡكَٰفِرِينَ","for the disbelievers"],["عَذَابَ","(is the) punishment"],["ٱلنَّارِ","(of) the Fire"]]},{"s":55,"a":15,"en":"And He created the jinn from a smokeless flame of fire.","w":[["وَخَلَقَ","And He created"],["ٱلۡجَآنَّ","the jinn"],["مِن","from"],["مَّارِجٖ","a smokeless flame"],["مِّن","of"],["نَّارٖ","fire"]]},{"s":100,"a":6,"en":"Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","mankind"],["لِرَبِّهِۦ","to his Lord"],["لَكَنُودٞ","(is) surely ungrateful"]]},{"s":22,"a":29,"en":"Then let them end their untidiness and fulfill their vows and perform Tawaf around the ancient House.\"","w":[["ثُمَّ","Then"],["لۡيَقۡضُواْ","let them end"],["تَفَثَهُمۡ","their prescribed duties"],["وَلۡيُوفُواْ","and fulfil"],["نُذُورَهُمۡ","their vows"],["وَلۡيَطَّوَّفُواْ","and circumambulate"],["بِٱلۡبَيۡتِ","the House"],["ٱلۡعَتِيقِ","[the] Ancient"]]},{"s":43,"a":3,"en":"Indeed, We have made it an Arabic Qur'an that you might understand.","w":[["إِنَّا","Indeed,We"],["جَعَلۡنَٰهُ","(have) made it"],["قُرۡءَٰنًا","a Quran"],["عَرَبِيّٗا","(in) Arabic"],["لَّعَلَّكُمۡ","so that you may"],["تَعۡقِلُونَ","understand"]]},{"s":26,"a":130,"en":"And when you strike, you strike as tyrants.","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when"],["بَطَشۡتُم","you seize"],["بَطَشۡتُمۡ","you seize"],["جَبَّارِينَ","(as) tyrants"]]},{"s":99,"a":8,"en":"And whoever does an atom's weight of evil will see it.","w":[["وَمَن","And whoever"],["يَعۡمَلۡ","does"],["مِثۡقَالَ","(equal to the) weight"],["ذَرَّةٖ","(of) an atom"],["شَرّٗا","evil"],["يَرَهُۥ","will see it"]]},{"s":113,"a":4,"en":"And from the evil of the blowers in knots","w":[["وَمِن","And from"],["شَرِّ","(the) evil"],["ٱلنَّفَّـٰثَٰتِ","(of) the blowers"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡعُقَدِ","the knots"]]},{"s":40,"a":81,"en":"And He shows you His signs. So which of the signs of Allah do you deny?","w":[["وَيُرِيكُمۡ","And He shows you"],["ءَايَٰتِهِۦ","His Signs"],["فَأَيَّ","Then which"],["ءَايَٰتِ","(of the) Signs"],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah"],["تُنكِرُونَ","will you deny"]]},{"s":84,"a":4,"en":"And has cast out that within it and relinquished [it]","w":[["وَأَلۡقَتۡ","And has cast out"],["مَا","what"],["فِيهَا","(is) in it"],["وَتَخَلَّتۡ","and becomes empty"]]},{"s":93,"a":9,"en":"So as for the orphan, do not oppress [him].","w":[["فَأَمَّا","So as for"],["ٱلۡيَتِيمَ","the orphan"],["فَلَا","then (do) not"],["تَقۡهَرۡ","oppress"]]},{"s":36,"a":29,"en":"It was not but one shout, and immediately they were extinguished.","w":[["إِن","Not"],["كَانَتۡ","it was"],["إِلَّا","but"],["صَيۡحَةٗ","a shout"],["وَٰحِدَةٗ","one"],["فَإِذَا","then behold"],["هُمۡ","They"],["خَٰمِدُونَ","(were) extinguished"]]},{"s":17,"a":106,"en":"And [it is] a Qur'an which We have separated [by intervals] that you might recite it to the people over a prolonged period. And We have sent it down progressively.","w":[["وَقُرۡءَانٗا","And the Quran"],["فَرَقۡنَٰهُ","We have divided"],["لِتَقۡرَأَهُۥ","that you might recite it"],["عَلَى","to"],["ٱلنَّاسِ","the people"],["عَلَىٰ","at"],["مُكۡثٖ","intervals"],["وَنَزَّلۡنَٰهُ","And We have revealed it"],["تَنزِيلٗا","(in) stages"]]}]